{"c":[{"name":"20261003T234914Z-993bc2a42fa75599","text":"Input posted to a pid (CGEventPostToPid) resets HIDIdleTime like a person's (B20: 196 s to 0.3 s); GUI evals that post input record their last post (helper/scripts/synthetic-input.ts) or the idle gate stops them as 'user back'.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T234914Z-ac2ee9392ce81473","text":"TextEdit cannot host a B19 routine: a shape is (source template, part, destination template) with no positions, a document is one text area, values copied from list lines share one source template, and engine.plan writes one value per field (B20).","type":"note"}]}
